{"id":"0542681240cab653","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-df-zfc-forcing4-forces-atomic-membership.md","title":"ZFC Forcing4 Forces Atomic Membership","display":"df-zfc-forcing4-forces-atomic-membership — ZFC Forcing4 Forces Atomic Membership","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-forcing4-forces-atomic-membership","aliases":["58-df-zfc-forcing4-forces-atomic-membership"],"display":"df-zfc-forcing4-forces-atomic-membership — ZFC Forcing4 Forces Atomic Membership","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","[[../batch09/58-df-p-name.md]]","[[../batch14/58-df-forcing-relation.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-forcing4-forces-atomic-membership"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-forcing4-forces-atomic-membership</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-forcing4-forces-atomic-membership — ZFC Forcing4 Forces Atomic Membership"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"51e31cce24feee5c\" href=\"?note=51e31cce24feee5c\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-p-name.md\">../batch09/58-df-p-name.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"46b2495f214783c3\" href=\"?note=46b2495f214783c3\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-forcing-relation.md\">../batch14/58-df-forcing-relation.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},p,\\sigma,\\tau\\in V,\\ \\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\in M,\\ p\\in\\mathbb P\">\\(M,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},p,\\sigma,\\tau\\in V,\\ \\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\in M,\\ p\\in\\mathbb P\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PName}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{PName}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"51e31cce24feee5c\" href=\"?note=51e31cce24feee5c\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-p-name.md\">../batch09/58-df-p-name.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma,\\tau\\in M,\\ \\mathrm{PName}_S(\\sigma,\\mathbb P)\\land\\mathrm{PName}_S(\\tau,\\mathbb P)\">\\(\\sigma,\\tau\\in M,\\ \\mathrm{PName}_S(\\sigma,\\mathbb P)\\land\\mathrm{PName}_S(\\tau,\\mathbb P)\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing4ForcesAtomicMembership}_S:V^6\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing4ForcesAtomicMembership}_S:V^6\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ForcingRelation}_S\\subseteq V^6\">\\(\\mathrm{ForcingRelation}_S\\subseteq V^6\\)</span> (fully parameterized forcing relation; see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"46b2495f214783c3\" href=\"?note=46b2495f214783c3\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-forcing-relation.md\">../batch14/58-df-forcing-relation.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing4\\text{-}forces\\text{-}atomic\\text{-}membership}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcing4ForcesAtomicMembership}_S(M,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},p,\\sigma,\\tau)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{Poset}(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\n\\land\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\in M\n\\land p\\in\\mathbb P\n\\land\\sigma,\\tau\\in M\n\\land\\mathrm{PName}_S(\\sigma,\\mathbb P)\n\\land\\mathrm{PName}_S(\\tau,\\mathbb P)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall q\\in\\mathbb P\\;\\Bigl(q\\leq_{\\mathbb P}p\\to\n\\exists r\\in\\mathbb P\\;\\exists\\langle\\rho,s\\rangle\\in\\tau\\;\\Bigl(\nr\\leq_{\\mathbb P}q\\land r\\leq_{\\mathbb P}s\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{43mm}\\land\\mathrm{ForcingRelation}_S\n\\bigl(M,r,\\ulcorner v_0\\doteq v_1\\urcorner,\n\\langle\\sigma,\\rho\\rangle,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\bigr)\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing4\\text{-}forces\\text{-}atomic\\text{-}membership}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcing4ForcesAtomicMembership}_S(M,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},p,\\sigma,\\tau)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{Poset}(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\n\\land\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\in M\n\\land p\\in\\mathbb P\n\\land\\sigma,\\tau\\in M\n\\land\\mathrm{PName}_S(\\sigma,\\mathbb P)\n\\land\\mathrm{PName}_S(\\tau,\\mathbb P)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall q\\in\\mathbb P\\;\\Bigl(q\\leq_{\\mathbb P}p\\to\n\\exists r\\in\\mathbb P\\;\\exists\\langle\\rho,s\\rangle\\in\\tau\\;\\Bigl(\nr\\leq_{\\mathbb P}q\\land r\\leq_{\\mathbb P}s\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{43mm}\\land\\mathrm{ForcingRelation}_S\n\\bigl(M,r,\\ulcorner v_0\\doteq v_1\\urcorner,\n\\langle\\sigma,\\rho\\rangle,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\bigr)\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The displayed density clause is the recursive atomic-membership forcing clause. Equality is supplied as an object-language formula code with its two-name tuple, and the ground model, forcing carrier, and order are all passed to the canonical six-place forcing relation.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-p-name.md","status":"resolved","id":"51e31cce24feee5c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-p-name.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-forcing-relation.md","status":"resolved","id":"46b2495f214783c3","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-forcing-relation.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-p-name.md","status":"resolved","id":"51e31cce24feee5c","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PName}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch09/58-df-p-name.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Poset}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-forcing-relation.md","status":"resolved","id":"46b2495f214783c3","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ForcingRelation}_S\\subseteq V^6$ (fully parameterized forcing relation; see [[../batch14/58-df-forcing-relation.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},p,\\sigma,\\tau\\in V,\\ \\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\in M,\\ p\\in\\mathbb P","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PName}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma,\\tau\\in M,\\ \\mathrm{PName}_S(\\sigma,\\mathbb P)\\land\\mathrm{PName}_S(\\tau,\\mathbb P)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing4ForcesAtomicMembership}_S:V^6\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Poset}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ForcingRelation}_S\\subseteq V^6","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing4\\text{-}forces\\text{-}atomic\\text{-}membership}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcing4ForcesAtomicMembership}_S(M,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},p,\\sigma,\\tau)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\\mathrm{Poset}(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\n\\land\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\in M\n\\land p\\in\\mathbb P\n\\land\\sigma,\\tau\\in M\n\\land\\mathrm{PName}_S(\\sigma,\\mathbb P)\n\\land\\mathrm{PName}_S(\\tau,\\mathbb P)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall q\\in\\mathbb P\\;\\Bigl(q\\leq_{\\mathbb P}p\\to\n\\exists r\\in\\mathbb P\\;\\exists\\langle\\rho,s\\rangle\\in\\tau\\;\\Bigl(\nr\\leq_{\\mathbb P}q\\land r\\leq_{\\mathbb P}s\\\\\n&\\hspace{43mm}\\land\\mathrm{ForcingRelation}_S\n\\bigl(M,r,\\ulcorner v_0\\doteq v_1\\urcorner,\n\\langle\\sigma,\\rho\\rangle,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\bigr)\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":2171,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2092","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-zfc-forcing4-forces-atomic-membership.md|58-df-zfc-forcing4-forces-atomic-membership]]（batch01）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","d3f859dbdd37f018","51e31cce24feee5c","46b2495f214783c3"]}